7.FACTORIAL 
Given a positive integer, n. Find the factorial of n.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            int factorial(int n) {
                if(n==0 || n==1){
                    return 1;
                }
                else{
                    return n*factorial(n-1);
                }
            }
        }
